 Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS/SBSAR files (<a href=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/what-are-sbs-sbsar-files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">what are these?</a>) for texture customization.</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><a style=\"outline-width: 0px !important; user-select: auto !important;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ckmaz66cusVpgH3cwtjGCL8j6BjPkdFW?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3138\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/28/fabric-011/button-download/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=1105%2C220&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1105,220\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"button-download\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=800%2C159&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3138\" title src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?resize=427%2C84&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"button-download\" width=\"427\" height=\"84\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3138\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/28/fabric-011/button-download/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=1105%2C220&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1105,220\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"button-download\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=800%2C159&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3138 lazyload\" title src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20427%2084%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" al